      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "春と、己の変化。\nその両方の訪れを覚えながら、\n旅人は往く――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6514b817419b89774d45c5ed91ea52a2a4d0312c622e182dee8f6d119c56c889",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
